Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.47,0:01:36.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"心爱的 我的思念让所有的词汇都黯然失色"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hever Castle Boleyn Family Home "Dear heart, I cannot say how much I miss you."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.02,0:01:41.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我渴求 在那夜晚 依偎在爱人怀中"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I wish myself, especially in the evening, in my sweetheart's arms..."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.70,0:01:46.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}继续念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pray. Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.89,0:01:52.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"美丽的双乳让我忘情狂吻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Whose pretty breasts I trust shortly to kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:56.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"钝笔拙舌岂能表达看不见你的痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Neither tongue nor pen can express the hurt of not seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:02:01.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"唯一的宽慰就是颤抖的企盼下次约会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"The only compensation is the thrill of anticipating our next meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:07.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"世上哪里有比挚爱情侣长相厮守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"For what joy in this world can be greater
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.09,0:02:11.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更快乐的事？"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than to have the company of her who is the most dearly loved."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.93,0:02:16.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.14,0:02:20.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王坦白了他对你的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the king is plainly in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:27.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道你看不出来 侄女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you see, niece,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.92,0:02:32.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这会让一个男人 随便一个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it makes a man any man
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.70,0:02:35.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脆弱的不堪一击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}extremely vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.97,0:02:39.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的想法是什么呢 爱女？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you like your charge, sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.91,0:02:42.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.61,0:02:47.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一开始我承认我并不是特别喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at first I confess I did not like it so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.73,0:02:50.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对国王毫无意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not care for the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.27,0:02:52.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但如今我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But now I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.48,0:02:55.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.39,0:03:00.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安 别被自己的伪装愚弄 对你来说是明智的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}anne, it would be wise for you not to be fooled by your own masquerade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.69,0:03:07.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的职责就是利用他的爱情 帮助我们排挤沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is your duty to use his love to our advantage in supplanting wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.45,0:03:16.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人是横在我们和自由之间的障碍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The cardinal stands between us and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.91,0:03:21.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在该你发挥能力给他致命一击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it is now in your power to do him a great hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:25.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都希望你能这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we expect you to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.87,0:03:29.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要直达巴黎去见弗朗西斯国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall go straight to paris to meet king francis
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:32.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}重新为两位陛下拟定一份新的条约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and ratify the new treaty between your majesties
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.53,0:03:37.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于教皇做了皇帝的阶下囚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and since his holiness remains a prisoner of the emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.06,0:03:42.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经召集各位主教在巴黎秘密开会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have summoned a conclave of the cardinals to meet in paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.35,0:03:45.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样一来 说服他们在教皇不得抽身的情况下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will be little matter to persuade them,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:50.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}授予我权限 也并非难事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the absence of the pope, to grant me license and authority
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.26,0:03:54.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把陛下的离婚大事做个了断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to make a final judgment on your majesty's annulment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:58.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有臣民都祈祷您一路顺风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You leave with our blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.90,0:04:02.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于预期的成功 主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And with anticipation of your success, your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:05.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们已经等得不耐烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For which we are most impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:08.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是陛下真诚而又谦卑的奴仆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am your majesty's true and humble servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:11.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 我忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:14.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你得带一个人去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is someone you should take.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.64,0:04:17.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的名字叫托马斯-怀亚特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His name is thomas wyatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:19.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个诗人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The poet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.21,0:04:21.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不喜欢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.33,0:04:24.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我曾有一块本该属于我的"珠宝"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He once possessed a jewel I would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.99,0:04:37.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安女士 你在这里有何贵干？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady anne, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:41.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来求见陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have an audience with his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.53,0:04:47.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个像你这么愚昧的女孩 有什么可对国王说的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What would a silly girl like you have to say to a king?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:54.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:22.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我他会成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me he'll succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:24.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁 宝贝？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who, sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:26.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:29.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会的 不是吗？他会得到离婚许可？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will, won't he? He'll get an annulment?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:32.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他当然会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:35.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}勿庸置疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.82,0:05:49.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 这样不奇怪吗？- 奇怪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Is it not strange? - Strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:54.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此重要的事情您却托付给一个奴仆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To trust so great a matter to just one servant,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:56.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管他是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whoever he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.15,0:06:00.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下您有上千名仆人 随时乐意为您赴汤蹈火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when your majesty has a thousand servants ready and willing to do your bidding
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.45,0:06:04.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且当您的幸福都悬于此事的定夺时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and when your very happiness hangs upon this resolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.78,0:06:07.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的爱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.44,0:06:11.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这事不需要你操心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This should not concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.74,0:06:17.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}原谅我 我说了不该说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me. I spoke of things I should not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:19.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:22.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我允许你我之间要经常坦诚相待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I give you leave that we may always speak freely with each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.66,0:06:27.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诚实 坦白 真心实意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}honestly, openly and with a true heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:31.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于我 这才是真爱的定义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For me that is the true definition of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.67,0:06:58.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恕我在这里见您 大使先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me, ambassador, for receiving you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.26,0:07:01.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听候陛下的吩咐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am at your majesty's disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:14.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}门多萨先生 请帮助我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Senor Mendoza. help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.43,0:07:17.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 我是陛下的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course, I am your Majesty's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:23.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要传信给皇上 我无路可走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need to get a message to the Emperor. I have no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.98,0:07:26.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃尔西浏览过我所有的信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wolsey opens all my letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.37,0:07:30.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在我还知道他买通了 我手下的几个侍女做他的间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now I know that he has turned several of my women into his spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:34.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用什么买通？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By what means?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:42.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用钱 或者更甚 她们告诉我 在性方面满足她们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By money or even, so they tell me, by granting them sexual favours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:48.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仁慈的上帝 我能帮您什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dear God. How can I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.49,0:07:51.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇上是我们家族的家长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Emperor is the head of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.23,0:07:55.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望他知道 国王要同我离婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want hime to know that the King is trying to divorce me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:59.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不想公开此事 但已经差人办理了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wants to keep it secret but he has already instigated proceedings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:01.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.18,0:08:04.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道他不需要教皇的许可吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely he needs the Pope's permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:08.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但教皇还在被皇帝关押着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the Pope is still the Emperor's prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:11.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}门多萨先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Senor Mendoza,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.50,0:08:14.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在仁爱的耶稣救世主的份上 看在众神敬畏的份上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the love of our saviour, Jesus Christ, and the love of all that is sacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.98,0:08:18.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我的侄儿我在这里所受的冷遇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}tell my nephew what is being done to me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:20.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}包在我身上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.19,0:08:24.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会想方设法避开主教的眼线的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will find a way to evade the Cardinal's spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.22,0:08:28.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.62,0:08:41.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}(卡普顿·威纳茨 沃里克郡)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.27,0:08:51.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在想什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:56.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wasn't thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:59.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.15,0:09:02.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在做新的曲子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're working on something new?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.17,0:09:08.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在摸索一些我需要听到的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To work on something I have to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.52,0:09:17.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:20.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你的妻子怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What about your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:25.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你很清楚她不是我的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know very well she's not my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:29.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从不相信爱情要落入教条的窠臼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've never believed that love should be bound by doctrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:36.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm going away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:41.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要走了？为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're going away? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.65,0:09:45.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红衣主教沃尔西要去法国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cardinal wolsey is going to france.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:50.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他邀我前去 与其他音乐家同行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He invited me to go with him. With other musicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.11,0:09:54.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你必须要去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Must you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.58,0:09:56.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你应当清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know very well that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:10:00.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教之令犹如国王之令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}an invitation from a cardinal is like an invitation from a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:04.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就算让我们这些小人物手入火盆 我们也只能"赴汤蹈火"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We little people must put our hands into the fire if we are "invited" to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:09.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会想你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.33,0:10:13.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 你不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No you won'T.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.43,0:10:18.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你很快就会移情别恋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll soon find other distractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:34.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我真话 这趟出访你有何希望？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me truthfully: What are your hopes for this mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:38.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有很多希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have many hopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:44.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首先 治愈多年来阿拉贡法兰西 你敌我对所留下的创伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Firstly, to heal the wounds caused by years of anglo-french hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.80,0:10:48.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后在谋取欧洲大陆新的权力平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then to work towards a new balance of power in europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:51.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗马之洗劫 教皇之囚牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sacking of rome, the imprisonment of the pope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:55.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些都动摇了整个欧洲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These things have destabilized the whole of europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.15,0:10:57.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有教派？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the church?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:11:01.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教派亦需调解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The church is also in need of mediation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:05.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特别秘密枢机会议上 我们将为教会理事会出谋划策…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At the special conclave we shall lay plans for a general council which
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.69,0:11:13.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在教皇缺席的情况下… 处理异端和改革这些当务之急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the absence of the pope will deal with the pressing matters of heresy and reform.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:16.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王的事情呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the king's matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:22.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此事也将处理 不过只是众多议题之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That will also be dealt with but as one of a number of other matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:27.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为其他主教会授权予你 解决此事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think the cardinals will give you the authority to deal with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:30.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.14,0:11:34.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么您就是事实上的教皇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you will be de facto pope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.09,0:11:36.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然那厢教皇不可能释放俘虏…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And since his holiness may never escape captivity...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:40.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是无稽之谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this is idle speculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:48.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还有事要做 托马斯大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have work to do, sir thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.15,0:12:13.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为何坐在黑暗之中？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are you sitting in the darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.34,0:12:23.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:26.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不懂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:28.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当然懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:30.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是你的哥哥 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm your brother, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:34.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还是当初的你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If only you were still as you used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.59,0:12:37.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我记得我毫无保留地告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I remember I told you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:41.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我的秘密 - 你依然可以告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- All my secrets. - You can still tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:45.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 不能 - 为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I can'T. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:48.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你泄漏给他人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'd share them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:59.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国 巴黎 国王弗朗西斯-瓦卢瓦的宫殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Palace of King Francis of Valois Paris, France
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.59,0:13:36.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.11,0:13:39.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们向您致敬 和蔼的主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We salute you, cardinal pacificus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.77,0:13:41.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也是和平使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cardinal of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.47,0:13:44.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mon cher cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.55,0:13:47.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的朋友来了 哈哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mon ami, venez! Ha!Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:49.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mon frere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.79,0:13:52.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您能加入我们是多么荣幸之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}C'est bon de vous avoir parmi nous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:55.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.07,0:13:57.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}见到您很高兴 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enchante, madame!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:14:01.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您如阳光一般美丽依旧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As beautiful as ever, like the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:04.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您如此的亲切 主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are very gracious, monsieur le cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.36,0:14:06.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 好像法国男人一样 - 就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Comme un homme francais! - Et voila.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.33,0:14:09.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们待您如兄长 因此您就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we treat you as a brother, for that is what you are:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:13.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法兰西真诚尊贵的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A true and loyal friend of france.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:15.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们欢迎您…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We welcome you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.86,0:14:20.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和你的随从 欢迎来到宫廷 奉上我们诚挚的心意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and all those with you, into our court and into our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:30.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真是三生有幸 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am greatly honoured, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:32.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且感动非常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And very touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:35.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 塔利斯 - 怀亚特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Tallis. - Mr. Wyatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.56,0:14:37.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.18,0:14:40.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许您能为我的诗谱一支曲子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps you would set a poem of mine to music.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:42.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很荣幸 你已有成品？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would be honoured. Do you have one ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.86,0:14:45.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在酝酿一首呢 第一句有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm working on one. I have the first line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:48.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后文思泉涌了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you have almost everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.82,0:14:58.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 日安 主教大人 - 日安 殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Bonjour, monsieur le cardinal. - Bonjour, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.42,0:15:02.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奥尔良公爵很高兴和玛丽公主订婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The duke of orleans is very glad to be betrothed to princess mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:04.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我非常乐意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:07.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 好样的 我的儿子 - 好样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Bravo mon fils! - Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:19.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对法国没多少好感吧 托马斯阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't like the french much, do you, sir thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:22.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也没什么成见 怀亚特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't mind them, mr. Wyatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:25.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是 他们总是那么的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just that they're always so very...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:27.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国特色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}french.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.30,0:15:45.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有我的信吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Were there any letters for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:50.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No letters, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:02.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady anne!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.18,0:16:08.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在 皇后陛下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, your majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:11.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know what you are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:18.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别想将国王从我身边夺走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But do not think to take the king away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.96,0:16:21.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他和你寻欢作乐 让他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let him play with you. Let him...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.91,0:16:24.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}馈赠你礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}give you gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.94,0:16:28.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他不可能对你一片真心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he cannot give you his true heart
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:33.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为他的心属于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for I have that in my keeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.56,0:16:58.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红衣主教沃尔西阁下的信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Letters from his eminence cardinal wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.17,0:17:07.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下理应知道 克莱蒙教皇圣人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty should know that his holiness, pope clement,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:10.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经逃出了天使堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has escaped from the castle sant'angelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:12.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他逃跑了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's escaped?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:18.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然他装扮成老盲人 蒙骗过了追捕者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apparently he dressed as an olblind man, and walked out past his captors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.65,0:17:20.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此刻他身居何处？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.49,0:17:25.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据在下所知 他在意大利的奥维多城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}According to my information, in an italian town called orvieto,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:28.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}藏身于他的宫廷仅存的当地主教殿内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the bishop's palace there, with what remains of his court.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.66,0:17:32.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 他仍在省罗马皇帝的控制范围之内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course, he is still within the power of the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.14,0:17:36.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而他自由了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet he is free?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:43.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有否可能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would be possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:50.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有否可能派人去他那里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it would be possible to send someone to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.19,0:17:52.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给他带个口信？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To give him a message?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:55.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed it would be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.07,0:18:02.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你如何得悉这些？沃尔西告诉你的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you know all this? From wolsey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.36,0:18:06.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是 陛下 我有自己的耳目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, majesty. I have my own sources.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:10.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么托人带话给教皇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us say I wanted a message carried to his holiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:15.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能找到人吗？一个足以让你托付性命的人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you know someone? Someone you could trust with your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.93,0:18:22.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}牧师兼外交官奈特博士 他是个地道忠心的英国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr.Knight.A man of god. A diplomat.And a true englishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:28.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带他来见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bring him to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.94,0:19:01.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}约克-托马斯-沃尔西大主教的地租负债\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Debts owning for land rental deu to the Archbishop, Thomas Wolsey of York
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:05.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}原来如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So that's how he does it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.67,0:19:25.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叫牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:37.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一对王后 我赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My 2 queens win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:41.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我痛恨打牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hate cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.60,0:19:43.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我痛恨皇宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hate this court.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.94,0:19:48.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我甚至痛恨时间本身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I even hate time itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:52.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 能听在下一言吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty, might I make a suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:54.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但说无妨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:57.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将皇宫抛到一边吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forget the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.67,0:20:00.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们去森林打猎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's go to the woods. Let's go for a hunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:02.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}象往常那样驰骋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as we used to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.71,0:20:06.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.37,0:20:08.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但不带布兰登\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But not brandon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:13.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 查尔斯是你的朋… - 我不能原谅萨福克勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Charles is your... - I haven't forgiven my lord suffolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.59,0:20:16.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法原谅他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:20.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他未经应允擅自迎娶我的王妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He never asked permission to marry my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.08,0:20:24.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这… 不可一世 让人忍无可忍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It'S... insufferable arrogance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:28.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他到底意欲如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, what did he expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.58,0:20:31.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听着…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:34.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是要将他永世逐出宫外…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't mean that he's banished forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.07,0:20:39.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就今生今世而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just as long as he breathes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.97,0:20:43.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:47.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}知道我们该干什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.24,0:20:49.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 干什么？亲爱的？- 野餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What, sweetheart? - Have a picnic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.51,0:20:52.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在康普顿的领地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At compton's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.11,0:20:58.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警惕周围动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.88,0:21:01.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎围捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Welcome round!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:15.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看 威廉 一切早已事过境迁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see william: Things can never be as they used to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.68,0:21:32.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯-博林爵士大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir thomas boleyn, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:39.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 大人… ？- 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- My lord...?! - Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我何德何能得您的到访？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To what do I owe this pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.20,0:21:47.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能容我直言吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I speak frankly?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.17,0:22:02.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你健康 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To your health, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.57,0:22:05.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也祝你健康\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.97,0:22:11.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诺福克派我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Norfolk has sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.52,0:22:13.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可诺福克恨我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But norfolk hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.30,0:22:16.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毕竟我初来乍到 而他高高在上 对我不屑一顾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am a new man, after all. And he is far too grand for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.92,0:22:20.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我怀疑出于同样的理由 他鄙视我们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I suspect he despises us all for the same reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.66,0:22:25.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而他原意庇护我们 及其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet he has interests to protect and further, like the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.40,0:22:28.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然他找上门来 就要和我们有所礼尚往来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He must deal with us as he finds us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.01,0:22:32.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毕竟 还有人让他恨之入骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And, after all, there is someone he hates even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.66,0:22:35.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 红衣主教 - 毋庸置疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- The cardinal. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.61,0:22:38.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但又与我何干？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But what is that to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.19,0:22:42.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怀念宫廷生活吗 大人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you miss the court, your grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.38,0:22:44.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps you don'T.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.98,0:22:49.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这片绿色的大地上 你可以尽情享受闲暇时光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Down here, in this green space, you have so much leisure to enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.98,0:22:53.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此多庸庸碌碌的追逐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So many idle pursuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.52,0:22:59.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而我却听人说 国王的毗邻宛似太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet I have heard it said by some that the king's presence is like the sun
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.50,0:23:04.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当你远离阳光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and when you are away from it,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.56,0:23:08.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}便只剩下茫茫无边的黑夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there is only eternal night.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.29,0:23:18.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是个聪明人 博林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're a clever man, boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.62,0:23:21.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人们都说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is what people say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.57,0:23:25.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说你魅力焕发 足智多谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They say you are charming and clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.46,0:23:29.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诺福克有何企图？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does norfolk want?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.88,0:23:39.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他希望你帮助我们除掉沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wants you to help us destroy wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.41,0:23:43.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为报答 他会劝说国王原谅你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in return, he will persuade the king to forgive you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.87,0:23:46.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并迎你回宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and welcome you back to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.78,0:23:51.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多谢你 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.36,0:24:12.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你听到了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.58,0:24:15.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一字不漏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.79,0:24:22.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.86,0:24:26.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.92,0:24:38.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你曾说 沃尔西有时待你非常和善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You once told me that sometimes wolsey had been kind to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.82,0:24:43.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.01,0:24:48.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我忘得七七八八了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had quite forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.34,0:25:05.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下似乎堕入了情网\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems our majesty is in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.57,0:25:07.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.80,0:25:32.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的哈利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poor harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.44,0:25:52.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}塔利斯… ？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tallis...?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.59,0:25:54.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.87,0:25:56.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你该死的诗人从不睡觉吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You bloody poets never sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.74,0:25:59.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我写了几行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've written the first few lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.35,0:26:02.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以读给你听吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can I read them to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.12,0:26:07.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"他们弃我而去 可我却赤脚"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"They flee from me that sometime did me seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.20,0:26:11.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"踱步在空荡的房间 自处寻觅"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"With naked foot, stalking in my chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.42,0:26:17.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我曾见他们温柔驯良"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I have seen them gentle, tame, and meek,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.05,0:26:21.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"如今却狂野不羁"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"that are now wild,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.65,0:26:25.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"全然忘却自己曾不顾一切危险"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"and do not remember "that sometime they put themselves in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.32,0:26:29.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"从我手心获取食粮"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"to take bread at my hand;
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.51,0:26:36.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"如今他们到处漫游 永无休止地寻求改变… "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"and now they range busily seeking with a continual change..."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.06,0:26:46.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 就写了这么点 - 写得很精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- that's all there is so far. - It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.24,0:26:48.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}字里行间充满了韵律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is music in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.45,0:26:50.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是关于什么的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's it about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.02,0:26:54.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 一个姑娘 - 什么姑娘？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- A girl. - What girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.93,0:26:57.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们就称她棕发姑娘吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's just call her the brunette.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.24,0:27:05.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一度爱过她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I loved her once.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.71,0:27:09.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}觉得她也爱过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I thought she loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.99,0:27:12.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可现在她已属他人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But now she belongs to another?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.17,0:27:16.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小伙子们 安静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Boy! Quiet in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.87,0:27:24.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许她只是寻常姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She may be just a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.65,0:27:27.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可我告诉你 塔利斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I tell you this mr. Tallis:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.36,0:27:29.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一旦让她达到她的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If she gets her way,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.92,0:27:34.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会让整个国家而咆哮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she will set our whole country in a roar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.83,0:27:39.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚上好 主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bonsoir, excellence.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.02,0:27:45.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.87,0:27:58.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下想确保阁下能得到一切所需\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty wants assurance that your eminence has everything you desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.05,0:28:05.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.28,0:28:14.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我年轻一点愚昧一点 或是精力旺盛一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I was younger, or more foolish, or more alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.70,0:28:17.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会欣然接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would gladly take this offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.35,0:28:21.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你美极了 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tu es trop belle, mademoiselle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.85,0:28:29.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不值得被他人如娼妇般利用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You deserve better than to be used as a whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.95,0:28:39.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安 主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bonne nuit, excellence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.52,0:28:49.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}众位 皇后驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lords and ladies, the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.04,0:28:56.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇后陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.45,0:28:57.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇后陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.90,0:29:00.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇后陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.94,0:29:03.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇后陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.80,0:29:05.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.52,0:29:08.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.34,0:29:11.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.06,0:29:17.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 达比大人 - 我的皇后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Lord darby. - My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.15,0:29:35.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有东西给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.53,0:29:42.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看见了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.25,0:29:44.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}猎鹰是你的羽饰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The falcon is your crest...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.35,0:29:47.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}石榴则归她所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the pomegranate is hers!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.62,0:29:51.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还是不明白 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You still don't understand, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.93,0:29:55.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是游戏 乔治 这里危机四伏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not a game, george. It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.03,0:30:02.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}博林女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mistress boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.44,0:30:05.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 克伦威尔先生 - 我带来了消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mr. Cromwell. - I have some news.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.61,0:30:09.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王派了个好手 持离婚信函去见教皇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king is dispatching a good man to see the pope, with letters about the divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.54,0:30:11.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奈特博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A dr.Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.90,0:30:14.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认识奈特博士 他是我的辅导教师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know dr.Knight. He was my tutor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.40,0:30:16.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.10,0:30:18.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切事物都相互关联…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All things connect...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.77,0:30:29.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.62,0:30:31.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.77,0:30:35.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜你们是皇后陛下的宫女？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would I be right to think you are maids of honour to her majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.16,0:30:36.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.81,0:30:38.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乔治-博林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}George boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.28,0:30:42.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们此刻不认识我 但总有认识我的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't know me now, but one day you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.87,0:30:48.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我们可以互捞好处 - 愿闻其详\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We could be useful to each other. - How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.04,0:30:51.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我你们在跟谁上床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You tell me who you're fucking,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.99,0:30:55.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后我再表达意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I'll tell you if it's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.44,0:30:57.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明白了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.76,0:31:00.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们有什么报酬？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.46,0:31:04.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会想出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.27,0:31:08.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就看你们对功名利禄有多么饥渴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It depends how hungry you are to be rich and famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.71,0:31:12.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以妥善做出安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's something I can arrange.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.51,0:31:16.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能创造财富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm a builder of fortunes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.09,0:31:20.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.28,0:31:22.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全靠你了 奈特博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We rely upon you, dr.Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.83,0:31:26.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将这两封信送到奥维多的教皇手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to deliver these 2 bulls to his holiness, at orvieto.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.68,0:31:29.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的亲笔书信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were written by our own hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.82,0:31:33.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.78,0:32:06.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}眼下若跟圣罗马皇帝讲和 对欧洲大有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would be better for europe if we now make peace with the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.69,0:32:10.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你胆敢这样说 ？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How can you say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.54,0:32:13.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他让我成为阶下囚 亲手捏了我的睾丸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He made me his prisoner! He squeezed my balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.40,0:32:15.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还索取我百万赎金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had to pay him millions in ransom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.53,0:32:19.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的长子仍是他阶下囚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And my eldest son is still his captive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.54,0:32:25.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我怎能跟这个混账讲和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How can I make peace with that piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.59,0:32:36.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发展到这一步 您一定感到心满意足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must be gratified by the progress you've made so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.43,0:32:39.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老实说 我已风烛残年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be honest, it's something of a burden dragging my old
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.41,0:32:41.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}往返国与国之间已成负担\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}cracked body from country to country.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.42,0:32:43.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您宁愿返回家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'd rather be at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.48,0:32:50.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想到我不在时 国王会受他人影响 我就感到忧心忡忡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do fret rather that the king will be influenced by others in my absence.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.56,0:32:55.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}经过这次秘密枢机会议 您勿需烦恼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After the conclave, you need not fret.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.05,0:32:58.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很快您就有权取悦他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll soon have the power to please him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.03,0:33:09.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good evening my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.84,0:33:11.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.23,0:33:23.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}衣童…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Boy...!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.48,0:33:29.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}衣童？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Boy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.53,0:33:33.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.73,0:34:05.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.17,0:34:17.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sweet anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.51,0:34:24.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇后驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.95,0:34:31.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.70,0:34:36.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只需片刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.39,0:34:41.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今晚我将和你的父亲和叔父共进晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tonight I dine with your father and uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.68,0:34:46.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我父亲自认受宠若惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty, my father says it is all beyond his deserving.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.46,0:34:54.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 与他们相处 拉近你我之间的距离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, for when I am with them, I am close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.40,0:34:58.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.13,0:35:05.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一个表达我爱慕之情的信物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Another token of my affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.39,0:35:06.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请收下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.78,0:35:10.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你卑微仆人的献礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From your humble servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.49,0:35:22.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的脖颈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.85,0:35:28.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我喜欢你的脖颈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.18,0:36:04.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人们 在此为我们心头大事的解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lords, let us drink to the resolution of the matter
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.77,0:36:07.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which is uppermost in our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.46,0:36:10.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 陛下请 - 陛下请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your majesty. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.21,0:36:15.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不久之后 我们就能得到答复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In a very short while we shall have an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.66,0:36:21.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比起红衣主教沃尔西 将此事托付给奈特博士让我更加放心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would trust to hear it more from dr.Knight than cardinal wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.42,0:36:23.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么这么说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.85,0:36:29.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我担心此事成功与否 并未关系到主教大人的利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear it is not in the cardinal's interest to succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.82,0:36:33.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是他的利益和我的利益 不是相辅相成的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But surely his interest and mine are one and the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.51,0:36:35.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是我的仆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is my servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.77,0:36:40.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人他的意思是红衣主教 对我的女儿有些许偏见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His grace means that the cardinal has some prejudice against my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.98,0:36:43.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.68,0:36:47.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他称她为愚昧的姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He called her a silly girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.34,0:36:49.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她跟我说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.42,0:36:55.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一件事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is another matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.28,0:36:57.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人他没想告诉你 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lord did not want to tell you, but
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.63,0:37:02.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为这件事情陛下您需要知晓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it is something I think your majesty should be made aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.09,0:37:06.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.59,0:37:10.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.79,0:37:15.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在您的眷顾下我被亲典为 陛下您的皇室财政审计大臣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by your great bounty I was appointed comptroller of your majesty's household.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.34,0:37:18.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于此职位 让我可以…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in such a capacity, I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.07,0:37:23.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发现 当腐败的修道院被关闭的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have discovered that, when corrupt religious houses are closed down,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.43,0:37:28.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们的财产并未按照规矩转入国库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}instead of all their assets going to your exchequer, as they should do,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.98,0:37:33.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}反而通常被转到他处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they are often diverted elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.17,0:37:37.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}转去哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.73,0:37:43.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}转入了沃尔西的私人基金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Into wolsey's private foundations.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.66,0:37:48.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用于他在牛津的大学建立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Into the creation of his great college at oxford.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.13,0:37:59.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不得不承认 你们的揭发让我倍感震惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must admit, I find your intimations shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.35,0:38:03.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确切的说 让我心痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed, I am hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.10,0:38:08.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红衣主教沃尔西不单是我的议政大臣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cardinal wolsey is not only my chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.10,0:38:11.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还一直都是我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he has always been my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.38,0:38:16.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 一个真诚和衷心的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In this world, majesty, a true and loyal friend
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.73,0:38:21.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一个男人在此世界里能得到的最大恩惠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is the greatest boon any man can have.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.07,0:38:26.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而其他人… 总是会有 顾己弃主的怪习惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For in everything else, there is a strange habit of forsaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.94,0:38:31.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说到这儿我想起来 萨福克公爵来见过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That reminds me, the duke of suffolk came to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.62,0:38:32.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱顿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Brandon?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.59,0:38:42.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说 他将手膝着地爬过来 以求得陛下您的原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He said he would crawl on his hands and knees to beg your majesty's forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.41,0:39:07.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那条项链 是谁给你的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That necklace. Who gave it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.21,0:39:11.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回答我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.89,0:39:17.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是陛下给的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.71,0:39:21.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你出价不低 嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are expensive, uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.78,0:39:23.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这个昂贵的妓女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}an expensive Whore!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.51,0:39:26.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是什么妓女…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am no whore...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.99,0:39:29.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.87,0:39:35.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱着国王陛下 我相信陛下他也爱着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love his majesty. I believe he loves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.19,0:39:43.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不过如男人为新事物着迷一样 被你冲昏了头脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is infatuated by you, as men often are by new things.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.26,0:39:46.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很快他会看到你真正的一面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soon he will see you for what you really are!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.90,0:39:50.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后厌倦你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he will tire of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.23,0:39:53.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如厌倦其他女人一般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}like all the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.13,0:39:59.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他不会厌倦我呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what if he does not?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.26,0:40:02.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可没准许你开口讲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not give you permission to speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.27,0:40:05.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你只是个贱婢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are a servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.62,0:40:08.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在给我出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.23,0:40:12.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}滚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.91,0:40:34.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国 胡昂乡间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Countryside near Rouen, France
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.66,0:40:40.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}驻步 驻步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Au pas! Au pas!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.49,0:40:42.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}喝喝… …\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whoa!...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.88,0:40:44.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}成列驻足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}En ligne!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.51,0:40:45.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.30,0:40:46.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奈特博士 请原谅我们冒然打扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr.Knight? Forgive us, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.83,0:40:49.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须请您在旅途中忙里偷闲一两天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must just ask you to break off your journey for a day or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.46,0:40:52.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么可能 我在为国王办事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Impossible! I am on the king's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.06,0:40:53.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确 先生 我们也知晓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir, we know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.23,0:40:55.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是为和您必须和我们走一趟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is why you must come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.70,0:41:05.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 奈特博士 请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, dr.Knight. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.81,0:41:06.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your eminence, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.64,0:41:11.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的事务就是要了解国王的事务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I make it my business to know the king's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.19,0:41:16.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真以为能在我毫无知晓的情况下 就送信到奥维多？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you really think you could go to orvieto without my knowing all about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.33,0:41:24.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你被命护送着两封御书给教皇 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, you've been sent by the king to the pope with these 2 bulls, is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.19,0:41:26.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.12,0:41:28.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这两封可是非比寻常的文书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are quite extraordinary documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.81,0:41:30.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可知里面是什么内容？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you know what is in them?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.61,0:41:32.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}略有所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.59,0:41:35.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你还同意护送着两封信？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you still agreed to carry them?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.35,0:41:43.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第一封文书请求教皇本人 批准他离婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The first document asks the pope to permit him once divorced
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.62,0:41:44.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并迎娶任何一位得他钟爱的女人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to marry any woman he chooses...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.00,0:41:47.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使由于她的一亲属与国王的旧事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even one who would normally be forbidden to him
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.49,0:41:50.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让她在常理下禁止与国王结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because of a prior relationship to one of her relatives!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.81,0:41:52.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不理解国王何以写此种书信？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't understand. The king wrote this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.01,0:41:54.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他所暗指的女人到底是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What woman is he referring about?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.14,0:41:57.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安-博林女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mistress anne boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.69,0:42:01.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安-博林？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne boleyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.46,0:42:06.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王爱的是安-博林？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king loves anne boleyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.33,0:42:08.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.66,0:42:15.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那他所提到的那段"旧事"指的是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what is this prior relationship he refers to?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.63,0:42:19.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人您肯定知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely your eminence is aware that
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.75,0:42:25.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下和安的姐姐玛利有过男女关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}his majesty had carnal relations with anne's older sister, mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.89,0:42:28.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至和她们的母亲都曾经云雨过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps even with their mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.77,0:42:32.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这都是传言 我并不会听信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So it is rumoured. I give it no credence.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.89,0:42:36.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是指关于她们母亲的传闻…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With regard to the mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.91,0:42:39.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么第二封书信 你看过了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the second document. Have you read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.90,0:42:41.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.32,0:42:43.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与之前一封如出一辙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}About just as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.41,0:42:46.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可不想将此信呈给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wouldn't like to be the man that has to present this
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.36,0:42:48.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}圣-彼得的传人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the descendant of saint peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.15,0:42:53.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面请求到"如果您无法废除我的婚姻"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It asks this: "If no way can be found to nullify the king's marriage...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.70,0:42:57.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"那么教皇理当批准他去娶第二个妻子"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}" then the pope should simply allow him to take a second wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.59,0:43:02.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你明白了吗？他要求教皇批准重婚之罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you understand? He's asking the pope to sanction bigamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.80,0:43:12.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然是国王下令的 你还是上路吧 奈特博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since the king commands it, you must be on your way, dr.Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.79,0:43:17.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是别指望能成功 更别提得到任何荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But with no hope of success... or honour.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.67,0:43:34.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听说你如狗一般爬过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I heard you crawled here like a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.97,0:43:38.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}差不多… 管住你的舌头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Something like. Hold your tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.59,0:43:41.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你一直都善用自己的花言巧语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were always too useful with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.58,0:43:43.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.85,0:43:46.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是来乞求我的原谅？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you come to beg my forgiveness?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.56,0:43:48.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.05,0:43:55.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就求我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well then beg for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.92,0:44:07.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以我的心 我的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With all my heart. With all my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.64,0:44:09.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以我生命的每一分毫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With every ounce of my being.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.74,0:44:12.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向我的国王 我的君主 我令人畏惧的主子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My king, my sovereign, my dread lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.30,0:44:15.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乞求您原谅这位可怜的仆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you to forgive your miserable servant,...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.99,0:44:19.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的卑微 毫无价值 不知事前深思的仆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your humble, worthless, thoughtless servant,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.20,0:44:23.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位不配接受您的恩赐及您的眷顾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who deserved so little and by your bounty and your grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.94,0:44:26.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却又蒙受恩宠的仆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was given so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.32,0:44:29.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这样知恩不报龌蹉下流之徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ungrateful wretch that I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.84,0:44:33.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不配陛下您的宠爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unworthy of your majesty's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.92,0:44:42.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.52,0:45:13.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你能击败我 你就可以重返宫廷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you can beat me, you can come back to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.17,0:45:17.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.52,0:46:34.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.06,0:46:59.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 那我又能怎么办？- 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What was I supposed to do? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.26,0:47:02.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我与您有同感 此书信的确粗鲁不可接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I agree with you. It was crude and unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.64,0:47:07.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我对陛下深感失望 - 托马斯 我必须问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I'm disappointed in his majesty. - Thomas, I have to ask you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.32,0:47:11.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会接受红衣主教教会的合议吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you accept the judgment of the cardinals?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.08,0:47:12.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在这又有何所谓？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does it matter now?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.93,0:47:14.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇已经是自由之身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The pope is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.80,0:47:16.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无须枢机会议的参与\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no need for a conclave.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.18,0:47:18.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 此时此刻更加需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is more need than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.00,0:47:20.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇依旧在圣罗马帝国的控制中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The pope is still in the power of the emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.56,0:47:23.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无法执行任何对教会的控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unable to exercise any control over the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.76,0:47:28.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以必须有其他人接手 我再次问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So someone else must do so and I ask you again,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.69,0:47:33.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可否会顺从红衣主教教会的合议？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will you accept the judgment of the cardinals?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.33,0:47:34.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚者…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.84,0:47:39.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你不赞同我 那么你就是在反对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you are not for me now, then you are against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.27,0:47:40.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}形势越发的危急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The stakes have grown higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.90,0:47:44.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生告诉我 国王与诺福克及博林共进晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Cromwell tells me that the king now dines with norfolk and boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.65,0:47:48.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们可都是我的死敌 他们一直都寻求机会让我下台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are my bitter enemies. They constantly seek my downfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.97,0:47:52.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你不帮助我 那你就是在帮他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if you do not help me, then you help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.61,0:47:55.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要提醒你:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And need I remind you of this:
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.61,0:48:01.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的步步高升都是我的功劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You owe all your advancement in this world to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.52,0:48:07.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯 我们相识以久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas, we've known each other a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.80,0:48:12.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你对我的处事手段及我的行为而抱怨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know you've often complained about my methods, my way of dealing, but
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.05,0:48:15.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但将这些置之度外 相信你我之间依旧有很多共同之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}underneath all of that, I believe we still share many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.90,0:48:18.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使全世界在抨击我们的信仰 逼迫我们妥协\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're still humanists, even though the world batters our beliefs,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.99,0:48:21.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们始终都是人道主义者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and compromises our actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.89,0:48:22.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有任何事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.82,0:48:26.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这世上没有任何事情 甚至没有任何一位王公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No earthly thing, not even a prince
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.75,0:48:28.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能够让我将信仰妥协\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will ever compromise mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.36,0:48:31.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.30,0:48:36.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不想深陷泥潭 我理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't want to get your hands dirty. I understand, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.05,0:48:38.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但不幸的是 你没得选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unfortunately, you don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.83,0:48:44.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}染坊工的双手总会被他的工作原料而浸染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The dyer's hand is always stained by the elements he works with.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.35,0:48:54.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是我的原料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here is my element.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.80,0:48:57.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}精神之元素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The spiritual element.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.64,0:49:00.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}高层次的元素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The higher element.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.06,0:49:08.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在你说说看: 我有被它玷污吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now you tell me: Am I stained by it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.49,0:49:22.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红衣主教们到的时候知会我一声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me know the moment the cardinals arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.61,0:50:29.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国国王陛下驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sa majeste le roi de france.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.47,0:50:34.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mon cher wolsey,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.04,0:50:36.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来此是告诉您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I expect you heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.76,0:50:39.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红衣主教们不会来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The cardinals are not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.65,0:50:43.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无能为力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's nothing I can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.83,0:50:47.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们只听从教皇的指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They only take orders from his holiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.55,0:51:01.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}时过境迁 我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The wheel turns my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.96,0:51:09.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"他们弃我而去 可我却赤脚"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"They flee from me, that sometime did me seek,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.23,0:51:14.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"踱步于房间内 四处寻觅"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with naked foot, stalking in my chamber...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.68,0:51:21.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"若非上苍 此刻已百般恩爱 美好万分"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"thanks be to fortune, it has been otherwise "twenty times better
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.17,0:51:26.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"但是曾经一度恍然"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"but once in special,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.46,0:51:30.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"在芊薄玲珑 悦目的装扮下"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"in thin array, after a pleasant guise,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.01,0:51:35.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"当她宽松的衣袍自细肩滑落"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"when her loose gown from her shoulders did fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.33,0:51:39.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"她将我环抱在纤细的手臂中"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"and she caught me in her arms long and small,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.19,0:51:44.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"一边甜蜜的轻吻着我 一边低柔的话道"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"therewith all sweetly did me kiss, and softly said:
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.46,0:51:49.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"亲爱的心上人 你可否倾心于此？"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Dear heart how like you this?"
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.00,0:52:22.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人 您能保佑我的女儿吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your eminence, your blessing on my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.63,0:52:25.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 上帝保佑你 我的孩子 - 感谢您 主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Blessings, my child. - Thank you, your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.44,0:52:28.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 主教大人 可否占用您些许时间？- 不可 不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Your eminence, if you please a moment. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.67,0:52:34.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 克伦威尔先生 - 主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mr. Cromwell. - Your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.04,0:52:36.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 国王正在等候您 但是… - 但是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- The king waits you but... - but what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.93,0:52:39.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他并非一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.27,0:52:51.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.10,0:52:53.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎样… ？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well...?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.21,0:52:58.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我本以为能够…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty, I... I was hoping that...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.92,0:53:02.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以在博林女士面前畅言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you can speak freely in front of mistress boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.61,0:53:05.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她知晓一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She knows everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.40,0:53:11.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.01,0:53:13.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你从巴黎归来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've come back from paris!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.83,0:53:14.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.86,0:53:17.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟我们讲讲你的凯旋而归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell us of your triumphs!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.15,0:53:20.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}讲讲你的好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell us all your news.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.65,0:53:24.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们迫切的想听到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are so eager to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.72,0:53:30.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 神人眷顾之人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh for the love of god man,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.93,0:53:34.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可否离婚？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}do I have my divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.64,0:53:46.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下可还记得 我去巴黎…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty will recall that I went to paris...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.14,0:53:48.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"没有梦想"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it was no dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.73,0:53:51.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我神志清醒的舒展而卧"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I lay broad waking.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.78,0:53:55.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"但我的温情突然之间"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But all is turned, through my gentleness,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.29,0:54:00.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"招来了挥之而去的遗弃"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}into a strange fashion of forsaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.54,0:54:04.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"而我却要为她的安逸远走高飞"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I have leave to go of her goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.72,0:54:09.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"既然我被如此冷善的对待"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But since that I so kindly am served
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.63,0:54:14.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我想知道 她又配得到什么？"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd like to know what she has deserved!
